{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06908","headline":"送楚十少府 · 常建","name":"送楚十少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微风吹霜气，寒影明前除。\n落日未能别，萧萧林木虚。\n愁烟闭千里，仙尉其何如。\n因送别鹤操，赠之双鲤鱼。\n鲤鱼在金盘，别鹤哀有余。\n心事则如此，请君开素书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}